{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_067F40","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"核威慑能抑制国家间冲突中使用核武器。但除此之外呢？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"除此之外？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"近年来，世界各地的恐怖活动越来越激烈。从分离独立运动到极左破坏活动都有。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"如果核武器落到这些恐怖分子手里，会怎么样？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"他们不是国家，也就是说没有固定领土，因此遭受核攻击的可能性很低。也就没有理由害怕核攻击。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":132,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"反过来说，他们也就没有理由犹豫是否对敌对的国家组织发动核攻击。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"面对恐怖组织，就算拥有再多<R=洲际弹道导弹,ICBM>和战略轰炸机，也确实没有用武之地。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=洲际弹道导弹,ICBM>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"对吧？当然，现在还只是个假设。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"核武器受到严格管理，不会那么轻易流入恐怖组织手中。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"但总有一天，“核恐怖主义”这个命题或许会让核威慑理论变成一纸空文。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"核恐怖主义……原来如此。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""}]}